OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed with other
OL,4,Aspecies affected, charity says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 20 birds have died from bird
OL,7,Fflu over the past fortnight in
OL,8,FBerkshire, a charity has said.
OL,10,FWendy Hermon, Swan Support's operations
OL,11,Fdirector, said it is the second wave
OL,12,Fseen in the county in 2026 after
OL,13,Fanother affected birds in the winter
OL,14,Fand spring.
OL,16,F"Normally it hits and then it's about
OL,17,Ftwo years later [it returns]. I don't
OL,18,Fknow what's going on... I think it's
OL,19,Fgoing to be a massive outbreak," she
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
