OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed with other
OL,4,Aspecies affected, charity says
OL,5,
OL,6,FReading and West Berkshire councils
OL,7,Fhave said they were aware of recent
OL,8,Fcases in their respective areas and
OL,9,Fhave urged people not to touch sick or
OL,10,Fdead birds.
